  "notes": "13 CSS custom properties, e.g. --camo-0, --camo-1, --camo-2, --camo-3.\n\nUse: npm i open-props, then @import \"open-props/camo\" (or copy the variables).\n\nOriginal file: https://github.com/argyleink/open-props/blob/main/src/props.camo.css",
  "code": "<style>\n:where(html) {\n  --camo-0: #f9fbe7;\n  --camo-1: #e8ed9c;\n  --camo-2: #d2df4e;\n  --camo-3: #c2ce34;\n  --camo-4: #b5bb2e;\n  --camo-5: #a7a827;\n  --camo-6: #999621;\n  --camo-7: #8c851c;\n  --camo-8: #7e7416;\n  --camo-9: #6d6414;\n  --camo-10: #5d5411;\n  --camo-11: #4d460e;\n  --camo-12: #36300a;\n}\n.scale { font: 12px system-ui, sans-serif; width: min(720px, 100%); }\n.scale p { margin: 12px 0 4px; color: #555; }\n.scale .row { display: grid; grid-auto-flow: column; grid-auto-columns: 1fr; gap: 4px; }\n.scale .row div { height: 48px; border-radius: 6px; display: flex; align-items: end; padding: 4px; }\n.scale span { font-size: 10px; background: #fff9; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0 3px; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"scale\"><strong>Open Props camo</strong>\n<p>camo</p><div class=\"row\"><div style=\"background:#f9fbe7\" title=\"--camo-0: #f9fbe7\"><span>0</span></div><div style=\"background:#e8ed9c\" title=\"--camo-1: #e8ed9c\"><span>1</span></div><div style=\"background:#d2df4e\" title=\"--camo-2: #d2df4e\"><span>2</span></div><div style=\"background:#c2ce34\" title=\"--camo-3: #c2ce34\"><span>3</span></div><div style=\"background:#b5bb2e\" title=\"--camo-4: #b5bb2e\"><span>4</span></div><div style=\"background:#a7a827\" title=\"--camo-5: #a7a827\"><span>5</span></div><div style=\"background:#999621\" title=\"--camo-6: #999621\"><span>6</span></div><div style=\"background:#8c851c\" title=\"--camo-7: #8c851c\"><span>7</span></div><div style=\"background:#7e7416\" title=\"--camo-8: #7e7416\"><span>8</span></div><div style=\"background:#6d6414\" title=\"--camo-9: #6d6414\"><span>9</span></div><div style=\"background:#5d5411\" title=\"--camo-10: #5d5411\"><span>10</span></div><div style=\"background:#4d460e\" title=\"--camo-11: #4d460e\"><span>11</span></div><div style=\"background:#36300a\" title=\"--camo-12: #36300a\"><span>12</span></div></div>\n</div>",
